Subject: Adapt DevSpace localregistry printer for buildkit v0.31 progressui API

Origin: DHI-internal (buildkit v0.31 API compatibility)
Description: Replace removed DisplaySolveStatus with NewDisplay and UpdateFrom for local registry build progress output.
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/loft-sh/devspace.git 7f272dcf90653fa9b42bc4347f7f3f9a52b0e8b5
Verify: test alpine-3.23/6.yaml
Forwarded: not-needed (DevSpace 6.3.x has not adopted buildkit v0.31 progress UI yet)
Drop-When: never: loft-sh/devspace v6.3.21 still calls progressui.DisplaySolveStatus; drop after upstream merges buildkit v0.31 progressui wiring

buildkit v0.31 removed progressui.DisplaySolveStatus in favor of NewDisplay and Display.UpdateFrom. DevSpace 6.3.21 still calls the old API when DHI pins buildkit through go/bump for CVE remediation on github.com/moby/buildkit.

diff --git a/pkg/devspace/build/builder/localregistry/printer.go b/pkg/devspace/build/builder/localregistry/printer.go
--- a/pkg/devspace/build/builder/localregistry/printer.go
+++ b/pkg/devspace/build/builder/localregistry/printer.go
@@ -38,7 +38,13 @@ func NewPrinter(ctx context.Context, out io.Writer) (progresswriter.Writer, error
 	}
 	go func() {
 		// not using shared context to not disrupt display but let is finish reporting errors
-		_, pw.err = progressui.DisplaySolveStatus(ctx, "", nil, out, statusCh)
+		disp, err := progressui.NewDisplay(out, progressui.AutoMode)
+		if err != nil {
+			pw.err = err
+			close(doneCh)
+			return
+		}
+		_, pw.err = disp.UpdateFrom(ctx, statusCh)
 		close(doneCh)
 	}()
 	return pw, nil
